    <a href="/services/project-recovery">the first job is an independent account of where it stands</a>.
    Verification joining late still pays; it simply works without the leverage the paperwork gave away.
  </p>

  <h2>What this isn’t</h2>
  <p>
    Not a second builder: we perform no construction work and hire no trades, and you contract directly with
    your general contractor. Not a guarantee: things go wrong on well-represented projects too — the
    difference is how early you find out, how good your information is, and what your file looks like when
    something must be resolved. And not a substitute for your builder’s own management, which a good project
    needs; <a href="/compare">the comparison page</a> sets out honestly where each model belongs.
  </p>

